This is a list of things you have to do
before shooting out a new release of JamMt
----------------------------------------
	[_] Run all unit tests (ant test)
	[_] Run all manual tests defined in 'resources/Manual_tests.otl'
	[_] Update the manual and the changelog
	[_] Update the version number
	[_] Tag the commit with the version number
	[_] Send an Email to { hann-ml, sim-group}@aei.mpg.de
